          "filename": "Dong Ba Market, 1969 (16240516948).jpg",
          "caption": "\"Dong Ba Market: Seen from the air, Hue’s largest market is the scene of bustling activity.  Following Tet, the market place, a prime factor in the reconstruction program, was rebuilt with the help of US ARVN troops (official USMC photo).\"\nFrom the Jonathan Abel Collection (COLL/3611), Marine Corps Archives &amp; Special Collections.\n\nOFFICIAL USMC PHOTOGRAPH",
