          "filename": "Dong Ba Market, 1969 (16240515118).jpg",
          "caption": "\"Market Day: River boats bring produce and fish to the Dong Ba Market in Hue.  Looming over the market, heavily damaged during Tet, is the new market building.  Construction of the building, halted during the offensive, is proceeding at a rapid pace (official USMC photo).\"\nFrom the Jonathan Abel Collection (COLL/3611), Marine Corps Archives &amp; Special Collections.\n\nOFFICIAL USMC PHOTOGRAPH",
          "alt": "\"Market Day: River boats bring produce and fish to the Dong Ba Market in Hue.  Looming over the market, heavily damaged during Tet, is the new market building.  Construction of the building, halted during the offensive, is proceeding at a rapid pace (official USMC photo).\"\nFrom the Jonathan Abel Collection (COLL/3611), Marine Corps Archives &amp; Special Collections.\n\nOFFICIAL USMC PHOTOGRAPH",
